    "detailed_description": "It was a magnificent feast in the peaceful Colored-Pencil Kingdom. One day, a strange wizard made the kingdom into darkness and disappeared. You, a brave adventurer, should save the kingdom by colorizing the world became dark and restore the kingdom peaceful again. Will you succeed in finding the wizard and saving the world?<br><br>Dark stuffs neither work nor move. You can animate the stuffs by using a colorizing-skill.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348220/extras/1808f6cd5a98c252b08076c1d99de1ec.poster.avif?t=1593776143\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348220/extras/1808f6cd5a98c252b08076c1d99de1ec.webm?t=1593776143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348220/extras/1808f6cd5a98c252b08076c1d99de1ec.mp4?t=1593776143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features of the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2D puzzle adventure using colorizing.<br></li><li>Originally, stuffs do not move. Animate the dark stuffs by colorizing.<br></li><li>Do not colorize things recklessly. You should consider where and when to colorize things within limited chances to colorize.<br></li><li>You could feel more interesting by empathizing with characters in the story.<br></li><li>The story is suitable for everyone, children and adults.<br></li><li>Give yourself peace of mind by playing this game.</li></ul>",
